<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Equity in Athletics Report</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
  .header-logo { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .header-logo img { max-width: 200px; height: auto; }
</style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #000;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f2f2f2;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .sub-header {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 10pt;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
  }
</style>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
  th, td { padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  .header { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .sub-header { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; }
  .label { font-weight: normal; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for Viterbo University Logo -->
    <span style="font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold;">VITERBO UNIVERSITY</span>
  </div>

  <h1>Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act Report {{ report_year }}</h1>

  <p>Any coeducational institution of higher education that participates in a federal student financial aid program and has an intercollegiate athletic program must provide information concerning their athletic programs under the Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act of 1994, Section 485(e) and (g) of the Higher Education Act of 1965, 20 U.S.C. 1092, 34 CFR 668.47.</p>

  <p>This act and accompanying federal regulations require that the following information, based on the previous reporting year, be available upon request to students, prospective students, and the public.</p>

  <p>Reporting Year: {{ reporting_year_range }}</p>

  <h2>Contents</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#male_female_students">Male/Female Undergraduate Students</a></li>
    <li><a href="#athlete_participation">Athlete Participation Counts</a></li>
    <li><a href="#revenue_expenses">Revenue and Expenses</a></li>
    <li><a href="#eada_info">EADA Institution and Survey Information</a></li>
  </ol>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 id="male_female_students">1. Male/Female Undergraduate Students</h2>

  <p>Male Undergraduate Students: <span data-field="male_undergraduate_students">{{ male_undergraduate_students }}</span></p>
  <p>Female Undergraduate Students: <span data-field="female_undergraduate_students">{{ female_undergraduate_students }}</span></p>
  <p>Enrollment numbers are from the IPEDS 12-Month Enrollment Report</p>

  <h2 id="athlete_participation">2. Athlete Participation Counts</h2>

  <h3>Men's Participation</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Team</th>
        <th>Number of Participants</th>
        <th>Number Participating on a Second Team</th>
        <th>Number Participating on a Third Team</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for team in men_teams %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="men_teams[{{ loop.index0 }}].team_name">{{ team.team_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="men_teams[{{ loop.index0 }}].participants">{{ team.participants }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="men_teams[{{ loop.index0 }}].second_team_participants">{{ team.second_team_participants }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="men_teams[{{ loop.index0 }}].third_team_participants">{{ team.third_team_participants }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr>
        <td>Total Men's Per Sport</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_men_per_sport">{{ total_men_per_sport }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="total_men_second_team">{{ total_men_second_team }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="total_men_third_team">{{ total_men_third_team }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Total UNDUPLICATED Men's Athletes</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_unduplicated_men">{{ total_unduplicated_men }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>Women's Participation</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Team</th>
        <th>Number of Participants</th>
        <th>Number Participating on a Second Team</th>
        <th>Number Participating on a Third Team</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for team in women_teams %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="women_teams[{{ loop.index0 }}].team_name">{{ team.team_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="women_teams[{{ loop.index0 }}].participants">{{ team.participants }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="women_teams[{{ loop.index0 }}].second_team_participants">{{ team.second_team_participants }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="women_teams[{{ loop.index0 }}].third_team_participants">{{ team.third_team_participants }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr>
        <td>Total Women's Per Sport</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_women_per_sport">{{ total_women_per_sport }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="total_women_second_team">{{ total_women_second_team }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="total_women_third_team">{{ total_women_third_team }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Total UNDUPLICATED Women's Athletes</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_unduplicated_women">{{ total_unduplicated_women }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 id="revenue_expenses">3. Revenue and Expenses</h2>

  <h3>Men's Basketball</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>SPORT</th>
        <th>Revenue</th>
        <th>Expenses</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for sport_data in men_basketball_sports %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="men_basketball_sports[{{ loop.index0 }}].sport_name">{{ sport_data.sport_name }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="men_basketball_sports[{{ loop.index0 }}].revenue">{{ sport_data.revenue }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="men_basketball_sports[{{ loop.index0 }}].expenses">{{ sport_data.expenses }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr>
        <td>Men's Teams Total</td>
        <td>$<span data-field="men_teams_total_revenue">{{ men_teams_total_revenue }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="men_teams_total_expenses">{{ men_teams_total_expenses }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Total MINUS Basketball</td>
        <td>$<span data-field="total_minus_basketball_revenue">{{ total_minus_basketball_revenue }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="total_minus_basketball_expenses">{{ total_minus_basketball_expenses }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>Women's Basketball</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>SPORT</th>
        <th>Revenue</th>
        <th>Expenses</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for sport_data in women_basketball_sports %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="women_basketball_sports[{{ loop.index0 }}].sport_name">{{ sport_data.sport_name }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="women_basketball_sports[{{ loop.index0 }}].revenue">{{ sport_data.revenue }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="women_basketball_sports[{{ loop.index0 }}].expenses">{{ sport_data.expenses }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr>
        <td>Women's Teams Total</td>
        <td>$<span data-field="women_teams_total_revenue">{{ women_teams_total_revenue }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="women_teams_total_expenses">{{ women_teams_total_expenses }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Total MINUS Basketball</td>
        <td>$<span data-field="total_minus_basketball_revenue_w">{{ total_minus_basketball_revenue_w }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="total_minus_basketball_expenses_w">{{ total_minus_basketball_expenses_w }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>Summary Totals</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Category</th>
        <th>Revenue</th>
        <th>Expenses</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Men's Teams Total</td>
        <td>$<span data-field="summary_men_total_revenue">{{ summary_men_total_revenue }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="summary_men_total_expenses">{{ summary_men_total_expenses }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Women's Teams Total</td>
        <td>$<span data-field="summary_women_total_revenue">{{ summary_women_total_revenue }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="summary_women_total_expenses">{{ summary_women_total_expenses }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Non-Allocated to Any Team</td>
        <td>$<span data-field="summary_non_allocated_revenue">{{ summary_non_allocated_revenue }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="summary_non_allocated_expenses">{{ summary_non_allocated_expenses }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>GRAND TOTAL</td>
        <td>$<span data-field="grand_total_revenue">{{ grand_total_revenue }}</span></td>
        <td>$<span data-field="grand_total_expenses">{{ grand_total_expenses }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 id="eada_info">4. EADA Institution and Survey Information</h2>

  <h3>Institution Information</h3>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Institution:</td>
      <td><span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span></td>
      <td>User ID:</td>
      <td><span data-field="user_id">{{ user_id }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3>Registration</h3>
  <form>
    <p>
      <label for="first_name">First Name *:</label>
      <input type="text" id="first_name" name="first_name" value="{{ first_name }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="last_name">Last Name *:</label>
      <input type="text" id="last_name" name="last_name" value="{{ last_name }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="title">Title:</label>
      <input type="text" id="title" name="title" value="{{ title }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="address1">Address 1 *:</label>
      <input type="text" id="address1" name="address1" value="{{ address1 }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="address2">Address 2:</label>
      <input type="text" id="address2" name="address2" value="{{ address2 }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="city">City *:</label>
      <input type="text" id="city" name="city" value="{{ city }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="state">State *:</label>
      <input type="text" id="state" name="state" value="{{ state }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="zip">Zip *:</label>
      <input type="text" id="zip" name="zip" value="{{ zip }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="phone">Phone *:</label>
      <input type="text" id="phone" name="phone" value="{{ phone }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="extension">Extension:</label>
      <input type="text" id="extension" name="extension" value="{{ extension }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="fax">Fax:</label>
      <input type="text" id="fax" name="fax" value="{{ fax }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="email_address">E-mail Address *:</label>
      <input type="email" id="email_address" name="email_address" value="{{ email_address }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="confirm_email_address">Confirm E-mail Address *:</label>
      <input type="email" id="confirm_email_address" name="confirm_email_address" value="{{ confirm_email_address }}">
    </p>
    <p>
      <label for="comment">Comment:</label>
      <textarea id="comment" name="comment">{{ comment }}</textarea>
    </p>
  </form>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2>Screening Questions</h2>
  <p>Please answer these questions carefully as your responses will determine which subsequent data entry screens are appropriate for your institution.</p>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>1. How will you report Operating (Game-day) Expenses?</legend>
    <label><input type="radio" name="expense_reporting_method" value="by_team"> By Team</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="expense_reporting_method" value="per_participant"> Per Participant</label>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>2. Select the type of varsity sports teams at your institution.</legend>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="sport_type" value="mens_teams"> Men's Teams</label><br>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="sport_type" value="womens_teams"> Women's Teams</label><br>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="sport_type" value="coed_teams"> Coed Teams</label>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>3. Do any of your teams have assistant coaches?</legend>
    <label><input type="radio" name="assistant_coaches" value="yes"> Yes</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="assistant_coaches" value="no"> No</label>
  </fieldset>

  <p>If you save the data on this screen, then return to the screen to make changes, note the following:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>If you select an additional type of team remember to include associated data for that type of team on subsequent screens.</li>
    <li>If you delete a type of team but have already entered associated data on other screens, all associated data for that type of team will be deleted from subsequent screens. However, because the survey system has to recalculate the totals, you must re-save every screen.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2>Sports Selection - Men's and Women's Teams</h2>
  <p>Select the varsity sports teams at your institution.</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Sport</th>
        <th>Men's</th>
        <th>Women's</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for sport in all_sports %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ sport.name }}</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox" name="men_sport_{{ sport.id }}" value="{{ sport.id }}"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox" name="women_sport_{{ sport.id }}" value="{{ sport.id }}"></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p><strong>CAVEAT</strong></p>
  <p>
    * If you indicated in the caveat box that your other sports are Dancing and/or Cheerleading, please specify in the caveat box that these are competitive varsity teams (i.e., not pep squads).
  </p>
  <p>If you save the data on this screen, then return to the screen to make changes, note the following:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>If you select an additional type of team remember to include associated data for that type of team on subsequent screens.</li>
    <li>If you delete a sport but have already entered associated data on other screens, all associated data for that sport will be deleted from subsequent screens. However, because the survey system has to recalculate the totals, you must re-save every screen.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2>Athletics Participation - Men's and Women's Teams</h2>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Varsity Teams</th>
        <th>Men's Teams</th>
        <th>Women's Teams</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for sport in all_sports %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ sport.name }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="participation_men[{{ loop.index0 }}].participants">{{ sport.men_participants }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="participation_women[{{ loop.index0 }}].participants">{{ sport.women_participants }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr>
        <td>Total Participants Men's and Women's Teams</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_participants_men">{{ total_participants_men }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="total_participants_women">{{ total_participants_women }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Unduplicated Count of Participants (This is a head count. If an individual participates on more than one team, count that individual only once on this line.)</td>
        <td><span data-field="total_unduplicated_men">{{ total_unduplicated_men }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="total_unduplicated_women">{{ total_unduplicated_women }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p><strong>CAVEAT</strong></p>
  <p>(For each men's or women's team that includes opposite sex participants, specify the number of male and the number of female students on that team in this caveat box. This does not apply for coed teams. Additionally, provide any other clarifying information here.)</p>

  <p>If you save the data on this screen, then return to the screen to make changes, please note you must re-save every screen because the survey system has to recalculate the totals.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2>Head Coaches - Men's Teams</h2>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Varsity Team</th>
        <th>Assigned to a Full-Time Employee</th>
        <th>Assigned to a Part-Time Employee or Volunteer</th>
        <th>Assigned to a Full-Time Employee or Volunteer</th>
        <th>Total Head Coaches</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for sport in all_sports %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ sport.name }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="head_coaches_men[{{ loop.index0 }}].full_time_employee">{{ sport.men_full_time_employee }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="head_coaches_men[{{ loop.index0 }}].part_time_employee_volunteer">{{ sport.men_part_time_employee_volunteer }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="head_coaches_men[{{ loop.index0 }}].full_time_employee_volunteer">{{ sport.men_full_time_employee_volunteer }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="head_coaches_men[{{ loop.index0 }}].total_head_coaches">{{ sport.men_total_head_coaches }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      <tr>
        <td>Totals</td>
        <td><span data-field="head_coaches_men_totals.full_time_employee">{{ head_coaches_men_totals.full_time_employee }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="head_coaches_men_totals.part_time_employee_volunteer">{{ head_coaches_men_totals.part_time_employee_volunteer }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="head_coaches_men_totals.full_time_employee_volunteer">{{ head_coaches_men_totals.full_time_employee_volunteer }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="head_coaches_men_totals.total_head_coaches">{{ head_coaches_men_totals.total_head_coaches }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p><strong>CAVEAT</strong></p>
  <p></p>
</div>


<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #000;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f2f2f2;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .sub-header {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 10pt;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    Institution: <span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span>
    <br>
    User ID: <span data-field="user_id">{{ user_id }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="header-title">Head Coaches - Women's Teams</div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">
    For each women's team, indicate whether the head coach is male or female, was assigned to the team on a full-time or part-time basis, and whether the coach was employed by the institution on a full-time basis or on a part-time or volunteer basis. The Swimming and Diving (combined) fields allow up to 2 head coaches. The Track and Field and Cross Country (combined) fields allow up to 3.
  </p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Varsity Teams</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Assigned to Team on a Full-Time Basis</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Part-Time Employee or Volunteer</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Assigned to Team on a Full-Time Basis</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Part-Time Employee or Volunteer</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Total Head Coaches</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="team_name_1">{{ team_name_1 }}</span></td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>1</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="team_name_2">{{ team_name_2 }}</span></td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>1</td>
